     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«として» presents the role or function; «にとって» indicates from what perspective something is judged.",
     "texto": [
      "教師として働く = to work as a teacher; 学生にとって大切 = important for a student. The translation may coincide, but the grammatical relationship changes.",
